# 🛠 SKILL — C-X-R Promotion

> **Authority**: ha:/ha/skills/cxr/cxr-model.ail (canonical SoT)
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/c-x-r-promotion.ail`

---

## SK-CXR-1 — Nguyên lý

> **draft-first, test-always, canon-once**

```yaml
zones:
  x_draft:
    path: "ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/x/"
    role: "Vùng nháp — T3C/AIA Coden, NAP commit daily, MUTABLE"
  r_runtime:
    path: "ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/r/"
    role: "Vùng kiểm thử — CTO/CSA, weekly, assembly + test"
  c_canon:
    path: "ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/c/"
    role: "Vùng bất biến — CSA/CEO, monthly seal, FAH vào Poly Ledger"
```

## SK-CXR-2 — Promotion Rules

```yaml
x_to_r:
  trigger: "NAP đủ điều kiện"
  requirements:
    - "NAP ≤ 120 LOC"
    - "single intent"
    - "atomic"
    - "stateless"
    - "deterministic"
  actor: "T3C-PRODUCER + CTO review"

r_to_c:
  trigger: "CAP đã stable"
  requirements:
    - "All invariant tests pass"
    - "CAP ≤ 1000 LOC"
    - "CSA approve"
    - "CEO seal"
  actor: "CSA + CEO"

rejection:
  trigger: "Same NAP fail 3+ lần"
  action: "CSA re-define spec"
  principle: "Không có 'đập đi xây lại' — chỉ re-cast NAP fail"
```

## SK-CXR-3 — Recipe

```powershell
# Bước 1: Tạo NAP trong x/
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/x/<nap-name>
# author src/<nap>.rs theo nano-scalization (≤120 LOC)

# Bước 2: Test trong x/ (smoke test)
cd ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/x/<nap-name>
cargo test

# Bước 3: Promote x/ → r/ (sau khi pass smoke)
Copy-Item -Recurse ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/x/<nap-name> ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/r/
cd ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/r/<nap-name>
cargo test --release

# Bước 4: Promote r/ → c/ (sau khi pass + CSA approve)
Copy-Item -Recurse ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/r/<nap-name> ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/c/
# CSA seal → Poly Ledger
```

## SK-CXR-4 — Sealed Artifact (CAP)

```yaml
cap_output:
  path: "ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/c/<nap-name>.cap"
  extensions: [".wasm", ".so", ".dll", ".ae", ".amo"]
  signed_by: "CSA / CEO"
  hash: "<blake3>"
  published_to: ["gh:cosda-dev/*", "gh:hugaalfatech/ros-go-olym"]
```

## SK-CXR-5 — Nano CASL Ladder

```yaml
casl_ladder:
  MIC:
    loc: "5-20 LOC, 1 function"
    actor: "T3C"
  NAP:
    loc: "30-120 LOC, ≤5 functions, ≤3 deps"
    actor: "T3C"
    afc: "EE.CC.RR.FF.nXX"
  CAP:
    loc: "150-1000 LOC, 3-12 NAP"
    actor: "CTO"
    afc: "EE.CC.RR.FF"
  NEP:
    loc: "1000-5000 LOC, 3-15 CAP"
    actor: "CSA"
  ME:
    loc: "5-20 NEP"
    actor: "CSA / Royal"
  SPACE:
    loc: "GitHub org / Cosda space"
```

## SK-CXR-6 — Hard Rules

| Rule | Code |
|---|---|
| CAP > 1000 LOC → REJECT | R001 |
| NAP must be atomic, stateless, deterministic | R002 |
| Only stable CAP/NEP may enter /c | R003 |
| nano-first, never top-down monolith | R004 |

